  "description": "** Please E-mail to register interest to view this property**   \n\nLovely 3 bedroomed Detached  property set on a lovely Private site near the Village of Ballitore.  The property is only a few minutes drive to the M9 Motorway. The property is new to the rental market. Accommodation comprises, fully equipped kitchen, with electric hob/oven/extractor fan, fridge & separate chest freezer and washing machine. Spacious Sitting room features a lovely open fireplace for cosy fires in the colder months. There are 3 bedrooms, the Master bedroom features a Double bed, and  built in wardrobes. Double bedroom also features built in wardrobes. The single bed features bunk beds and could also be used as an office. There is also a new beautifully finished bathroom/wetroom with feature shower, toilet and wash hand basin.\nThere are front and rear gardens, and  plenty of room for parking. There is an outside shed, even a greenhouse !. Also outside lights,  clothes line, & outside tap.\nBeautiful Countryside setting yet only a short walk  to the town with it's amenities including a shop/pub/school/ church/ Petrol station etc.. The M9 Motorway junction is only a short distance away. Oil fired Central heating. Security cameras.\nNo Pets allowed.\n*Written references required\n*Deposit required",
